  (text "6S PROP source / J104: 1 = 3 V bias, 2 = SHDN return"
    (at 30.48 219.71 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "b3de0690-0178-49a0-9953-c07195c585e9"))
  (text "R1006/R2006 = 22.1k local SHDN pull-downs on f01/f02. C1006/C2006 = edge filters, NOT debouncers.\nSHDN cycling resets a latched fault. Contact bounce can reset/retry or interrupt power; verify the installed switch.\nOFF still draws reference bias (~0.5 mA from 2S / ~2.3 mA from 6S, approximate). Unplug packs for storage.\nSemiconductor OFF is not galvanic isolation or energetic safing. Load and charging isolation remain separate."
    (at 15.24 242.57 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "e5401b11-0df4-4ab2-b5ec-ca44a59ec28f"))
